 the account increases by a factor of <math alttext=\"10\"><mn>10</mn>\n</math>, not doubles, every <math alttext=\"2\"><mn>2</mn>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"10\"><mn>10</mn>\n</math>, years.</p>","externalid":"29fc6f6a-c78f-4294-a4fc-98e4343406e7","correct_answer":["C"]},"createDate":1743430554981,"updateDate":1743430554981}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1743430554981, 1743430554981),
