his system is <math alttext=\"left parenthesis negative 2 comma 6 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>","stem":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><figure class='image'><svg aria-label=\"Graph of a system of a line and a curve in the x y plane with the origin labeled O. The x axis ranges from negative 9 to 6. The y axis ranges from negative 6 to 9. Refer to long description.\" role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 377.28 362.16\" width=\"377.28px\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<defs>\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n*{stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:round;}\n  </style>\n</defs>\n<g id=\"figure_1\">\n<g id=\"patch_1\">\n<path d=\"M 0 362.16 \nL 377.28 362.16 \nL 377.28 0 \nL 0 0 \nz\n\" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n</g>\n<g id=\"axes_1\">\n<g id=\"patch_2\">\n<path d=\"M 7.2 344.88 \nL 370.08 344.88 \nL 370.08 12.24 \nL 7.2 12.24 \nz\n\" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n</g>\n<g id=\"matplotlib.axis_1\"></g>\n<g id=\"matplotlib.axis_2\"></g>\n</g>\n<g id=\"axes_2\">\n<g id=\"patch_3\">\n<path d=\"M 15.211593 354.96 \nL 354.508407 354.96 \nL 354.508407 7.2 \nL 15.211593 7.2 \nz\n\" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n</g>\n<g id=\"matplotlib.axis_3\">\n<g id=\"xtick_1\"></g>\n<g id=\"xtick_2\"></g>\n<g id=\"xtick_3\"></g>\n<g id=\"xtick_4\"></g>\n<g id=\"xtick_5\"></g>\n<g id=\"xtick_6\"></g>\n<g id=\"xtick_7\"></g>\n<g id=\"xtick_8\"></g>\n</g>\n<g id=\"matplotlib.axis_4\">\n<g id=\"ytick_1\"></g>\n<g id=\"ytick_2\"></g>\n<g id=\"ytick_3\"></g>\n<g id=\"ytick_4\"></g>\n<g id=\"ytick_5\"></g>\n<g id=\"ytick_6\"></g>\n<g id=