</math>, in inches, <math alttext="x"><mi>x</mi>
</math> seconds after it started moving on an elevated track of a marble run. Which of the following is the best interpretation of the <math alttext="y"><mi>y</mi>
</math>-intercept of the graph?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"b283e3d9-7a95-46ef-897d-91c4caa812ed","content":"<p>The marble's height was <math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math> inches above the ground <math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math> seconds after it started moving.</p>"},{"id":"91c4e34a-5d62-4870-b072-6c75fee9c43f","content":"<p>The marble's height was <math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math> inches above the ground when it started moving.</p>"},{"id":"d60fc4b1-d962-45bf-9012-ca55431148ef","content":"<p>The marble's minimum height was <math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math> inches above the ground.</p>"},{"id":"281748d4-f9d4-4355-885f-5bd4e2dcada9","content":"<p>The marble's minimum height was <math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math> inches above the ground.</p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["B"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["91c4e34a-5d62-4870-b072-6c75fee9c43f"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">Choice B is correct. The <em>y</em>-intercept of a graph is the point at which the graph intersects the <em>y</em>-axis. The graph shown intersects the <em>y</em>-axis at the point <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="left parenthesis 0 comma 8 right parenthesis"><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>)</mo></math>. Therefore, the <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph is <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="left parenthesis 0 comma 8 right parenthesis"><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>)</mo></math>. It&rsquo;s given that <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="y"><mi>y</mi></math> is the height of the marble above the ground, in inches, and <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="x"><mi>x</mi></math> is the number of seconds after the marble started moving. It follows that the marble's height was <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="8"><mn>8</mn></math> inches above the ground <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="0"><mn>0</mn></math> seconds after it started moving. Therefore, the best interpretation of the <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph is that the marble&rsquo;s height was <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="8"><mn>8</mn></math> inches above the ground when it started moving.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"5e63b9cf","external_id":"e07cc332-1b7d-4d38-a472-8db2ff2d4e41","disclosed_item_id":null,"source":"qbank","vaultid":null,"uId":"845c611c-6df5-4b3e-9892-f37390df4113","program":"SAT","test_type":2,"test_type_desc":"Math","primary_class_cd":"P","domain":"Advanced Math","skill_cd":"P.C.","skill_desc":"Nonlinear functions","difficulty":"E","score_band_range_cd":1,"type":"mcq","stimulus":null,"stem":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><figure class='image'><svg version=\"1.0.0\" width=\"370px\" height=\"332.328125px\" viewBox=\"0 0 370 332.328125\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-label=\"Graph of a parabola in the x y plane with the origin labeled O. The x axis ranges from 0 to 10. The y axis ranges from 0 to 10. Refer to long description.\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow\" viewBox=\"0 -3 10 6\" markerUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" markerWidth=\"10px\" markerHeight=\"6px\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,-3 L10,0 L0,3\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></marker></defs><g class=\"graph-group\" transform=\"translate(50, 25)\"><g class=\"grid-group\"><g class=\"x-grid\"><line x1=\"0.5\" y1=\"286.328125\" x2=\"0.5\" y2=\"0\" stroke=\"#757576\" stroke-width=\"0\" class=\"x-grid\"></line><line x1=\"0.5\" y1=\"286.328125\" x2=\"0.5\" y2=\"0\" stroke=\"#757576\" stroke-width=\"0\" class=\"x-grid\"></line><line x1=\"27.939778645833332\" y1=\"286.328125\" x2=\"27.939778645833332\" y2=\"0\" stroke=\"#757576\" stroke-width=\"1px\" class=\"x-grid\"></line><line x1=\"55.379557291666664\" y1=\"286.328125\" x2=\"55.379557291666664\" y2=\"0\" stroke=\"#757576\" stroke-width=\"1px\" class=\"x-grid\"></line><line x1=\"82.81933593749999\" y1=\"286.328125\" x2=\"82.81933593749999\" y2=\"0\" stroke=\"#757576\" stroke-width=\"1px\" class=\"x-grid\"></line><line x1=\"110.2