lttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn></math> seconds after it started moving. Therefore, the best interpretation of the <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph is that the marble&rsquo;s height was <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn></math> inches above the ground when it started moving.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>","parenttemplatename":null,"parenttemplateid":null,"templateclusterid":null,"templateclustername":null,"origin":null,"position":null,"image_count":0,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1755117017725,"pPcc":"SAT#P","questionId":"5e63b9cf","skill_cd":"P.C.","score_band_range_cd":1,"skill_desc":"Nonlinear functions","createDate":1755117017725,"program":"SAT","primary_class_cd_desc":"Advanced Math","ibn":"","external_id":"e07cc332-1b7d-4d38-a472-8db2ff2d4e41","primary_class_cd":"P","uId":"845c611c-6df5-4b3e-9892-f37390df4113","difficulty":"E"},"raw_detail":{"type":"mcq","stem":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><figure class='image'><svg version=\"1.0.0\" width=\"370px\" height=\"332.328125px\" viewBox=\"0 0 370 332.328125\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-label=\"Graph of a parabola in the x y plane with the origin labeled O. The x axis ranges from 0 to 10. The y axis ranges from 0 to 10. Refer to long description.\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow\" viewBox=\"0 -3 10 6\" markerUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" markerWidth=\"10px\" markerHeight=\"6px\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,-3 L10,0 L0,3\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></marker></defs><g class=\"graph-group\" transform=\"translate(50, 25)\"><g class=\"grid-group\"><g class=\"x-grid\"><line x1=\"0.5\" y1=\"286.328125\" x2=\"0.5\" y2=\"0\" stroke=\"#757576\" stroke-width=\"0\" class=