marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"></line><text class=\"y-axis-label\" style=\"text-anchor: middle; dominant-baseline: text-after-edge; font-family: Noto Serif; font-style: italic; fill: currentColor; font-size: 15px;\" transform=\"translate(0,-12)\">y</text></g><text x=\"0\" y=\"286.328125\" dx=\"-13.25px\" dy=\"13.5px\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; font-family: Noto Serif;\">O</text><path d=\"M0,66.81L3.751,77.87L7.496,88.53L11.241,98.807L14.992,108.715L18.737,118.224L22.488,127.363L26.239,136.118L29.984,144.476L33.729,152.45L37.48,160.053L41.226,167.26L44.976,174.094L48.727,180.543L52.472,186.599L56.218,192.272L58.096,194.972L59.969,197.568L61.841,200.069L63.714,202.474L65.592,204.789L67.465,207.002L69.337,209.119L71.216,211.146L73.088,213.071L74.961,214.9L76.839,216.638L78.712,218.275L80.584,219.816L82.457,221.261L84.335,222.615L86.208,223.868L88.08,225.026L89.959,226.091L91.831,227.056L93.704,227.926L95.582,228.702L97.455,229.379L99.327,229.961L101.2,230.447L103.078,230.839L104.951,231.133L106.829,231.331L108.702,231.433L110.574,231.439L112.447,231.35L114.319,231.164L116.192,230.883L118.07,230.505L119.943,230.031L121.815,229.462L123.688,228.797L125.566,228.034L127.439,227.177L129.312,226.224L131.184,225.175L133.062,224.027L134.935,222.787L136.808,221.45L138.68,220.018L140.558,218.485L142.431,216.86L144.304,215.14L146.176,213.324L148.049,211.412L149.927,209.398L151.805,207.288L153.678,205.088L155.551,202.792L157.423,200.401L159.302,197.905L161.174,195.322L164.919,189.867L168.67,184.02L172.421,177.788L176.172,171.171L179.917,164.181L183.662,156.808L187.413,149.039L191.164,140.885L194.915,132.347L198.66,123.438L202.411,114.132L206.156,104.456L209.907,94.381L213.652,83.937L217.403,73.094L221.148,61.883L224.899,50.271L228.65,38.274L232.395,25.912L236.141,13.167L239.891,0.018\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2px\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"none\"></path></g></svg><div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Long description for graph of a parabola\" class=\"sr-only\"><ul>\n<li>The parabola opens upward.</li>\n<li>The vertex is at the point (4 comma 2).</li>\n<li>The parabola passes through the following points:<br/>\n<ul>\n<li>(0 comma 8)</li>\n<li>(4 comma 2)</li>\n<li>(8 comma 8)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul></div></figure></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The graph shows a marble's height above the ground <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi>\n</math>, in inches, <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> seconds after it started moving on an elevated track of a marble run. Which of the following is the best interpretation of the <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi>\n</math>-intercept of the graph?</p>","keys":["91c4e34a-5d62-4870-b072-6c75fee9c43f"],"answerOptions":[{"id":"b283e3d9-7a95-46ef-897d-91c4caa812ed","content":"<p>The marble's height was <math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math> inches above the ground <math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math> seconds after it started moving.</p>"},{"id":"91c4e34a-5d62-4870-b072-6c75fee9c43f","content":"<p>The marble's height was <math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math> inches above the ground when it started moving.</p>"},{"id":"d60fc4b1-d962-45bf-9012-ca55431148ef","content":"<p>The marble's minimum height was <math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math> inches above the ground.</p>"},{"id":"281748d4-f9d4-4355-885f-5bd4e2dcada9","content":"<p>The marble's minimum height was <math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math> inches above the ground.</p>"}],"rationale":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is correct. The <em>y</em>-intercept of a graph is the point at which the graph intersects the <em>y</em>-axis. The graph shown intersects the <em>y</em>-axis at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 8 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>)</mo></math>. Therefore, the <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 8 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>)</mo></math>. It&rsquo;s given that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi></math> is the height of the marble above the ground, in inches, and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi></math> is the number of seconds after the marble started moving. It follows that the marble's height was <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn></math> inches above the ground <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn></math> seconds after it started moving. Therefore, the best interpretation of the <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph is that the marble&rsquo;s height was <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn></math> inches above the ground when it started moving.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>","externalid":"e07cc332-1b7d-4d38-a472-8db2ff2d4e41","correct_answer":["B"]},"createDate":1755117017725,"updateDate":1755117017725}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1755117017725, 1755117017725),
