133107 \nL 209.348147 134.155319 \nL 211.030159 128.508183 \nL 212.712172 122.121553 \nL 214.394184 114.919908 \nL 216.076196 106.822084 \nL 217.758209 97.741 \nL 219.440221 87.583378 \nL 221.122234 76.249456 \nL 222.804246 63.632691 \nL 224.486259 49.619463 \nL 225.747768 38.120605 \nL 225.747768 38.120605 \n\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-width:2.3;\"></path>\n   </g>\n  </g>\n </g>\n <defs>\n  <clipPath id=\"p5e1593f52f\">\n   <rect height=\"260.82\" width=\"268.898496\" x=\"7.2\" y=\"7.2\"></rect>\n  </clipPath>\n </defs>\n</svg>\n<div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Long description for graph of a curve\" class=\"sr-only\"><ul><li>In quadrant 2, the curve falls to its minimum at the point (0 comma 4).</li><li>In quadrant 1, the curve then rises.</li></ul></div></figure></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The graph of the polynomial function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math>, where <math alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>, is shown. The <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph is <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma y right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi>\n</math>?</p>","answerOptions":null,"keys":["4"],"correct_answer":["4"],"rationale":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The correct answer is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"4\"><mn>4</mn></math>. The <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph of a function in the <em>xy</em>-plane is the point where the graph intersects the <em>y</em>-axis. The graph of the polynomial function shown intersects the <em>y</em>-axis at the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 4 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math>. It's given that the <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma y right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo></math>. Therefore, the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"4\"><mn>4</mn></math>.</p>","parenttemplatename":null,"parenttemplateid":null,"templateclusterid":null,"templateclustername":null,"origin":null,"position":null,"image_count":0,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1776362727993,"pPcc":"SAT#P","questionId":"5f07b257","skill_cd":"P.C.","score_band_range_cd":1,"skill_desc":"Nonlinear functions","createDate":1776362727993,"program":"SAT","primary_class_cd_desc":"Advanced Math","ibn":"","external_id":"d6f230e9-a5fd-4506-837c-cde890c380bc","primary_class_cd":"P","uId":"de42db77-30e0-41fe-a371-1e07ab601010","difficulty":"E"},"raw_detail":{"type":"spr","stem":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><figure class='image'><svg height=\"275.22pt\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 287.764248 275.22\" width=\"287.764248pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Graph of a curve in the x y plane with the origin labeled O. The x axis ranges from negative 1 to 1. The y axis ranges from negative 1 to 12. Refer to long description.\">\n <defs>\n  <style type=\"text/css\">\n*{stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:round;}\n  </style>\n </defs>\n <g id=\"figure_1\">\n  <g id=\"patch_1\">\n   <path d=\"M -0 275.22 \nL 287.764248 275.22 \nL 287.764248 0 \nL -0 0 \nz\n\" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n  </g>\n  <g id=\"axes_1\">\n   <g id=\"patch_2\">\n    <path d=\"M 8.404248 260.46 \nL 280.564248 260.46 \nL 280.564248 10.98 \nL 8.404248 10.98 \nz\n\" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n   </g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_1\"></g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_2\"></g>\n  </g>\n  <g id=\"axes_2\">\n   <g id=\"patch_3\">\n    <path d=\"M 7.2 268.02 \nL 276.098496 268.02 \nL 276.098496 7.2